{"id":"obvinit_","lemma":"обвинить","pos":"verb","rank":2170,"glosses":["to accuse, to charge, to blame"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/71/Ru-%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"future":{"1s":"обвиню","2s":"обвинишь","3s":"обвинит","1p":"обвиним","2p":"обвините","3p":"обвинят"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"обвини","2p":"обвините"}}},"past":{"m":"обвинил","p":"обвинили","f":"обвинила","n":"обвинило"},"aspect":"perfective","aspectPartner":"обвинять","examples":[{"text":"Том хочет нас обвинить.","en":"Tom wants to blame us.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"us","l":"мы"},null]},{"text":"Он обвинил меня.","en":"He put the blame upon me.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"me","l":"я"}]},{"text":"Они обвинили себя за ошибку.","en":"They blamed themselves for being wrong.","words":[{"g":"they"},null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"behind / for"},null]},{"text":"Полиция обвинила его в убийстве.","en":"The police accused him of murder.","words":[{"g":"police"},null,{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Я знал, что меня обвинят.","en":"I knew I'd be blamed.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},null]}]}